<title>UK: SOCCER-KUKA IS SOUTHAMPTON TARGET.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KUKA IS SOUTHAMPTON TARGET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league Southampton are believed to be trying to finance a deal for Czech Republic striker Pavel Kuka, currently with German side Kaiserslautern.</p>
<p>Southampton hope to sell England under-21 striker Neil Shipperley, who is having talks with Crystal Palace and Portsmouth.</p>
